  "claim": "William Paul \"Bill\" Barretta made film debut as a principal puppeteer in a movie as Clueless I Shrunk the Kids. That movie was produced after the film where Kristine Sutherland starred as Mrs Thompson.",
  "evidencia": "Page: Muppet Treasure Island. Sentence: Muppet Treasure Island is a 1996 American musical adventure comedy film based on Robert Louis Stevenson's \"Treasure Island\".\nPage: Honey, I Shrunk the Kids. Sentence: Honey, I Shrunk the Kids is a 1989 American comic science fiction film.\nPage: Bill Barretta. Sentence: His film debut as a principal puppeteer was in 1996's \"Muppet Treasure Island\" as Clueless Morgan.\nPage: Kristine Sutherland. Sentence: Kristine Sutherland (born Kristine Young; April 17, 1955) is an American actress best known for her starring as Buffy Summers' mother Joyce Summers on the television show \"Buffy The Vampire Slayer\", where she appeared in every season, and her role as Mrs. Thompson in \"Honey, I Shrunk the Kids\" (1989).",
